infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Same 100 KB bundle, 2x apart: delivery decides
  desc Identical bytes — LCP 1.4 s well delivered vs 2.3 s poorly delivered
  compares
    - label Well delivered: LCP 1.4 s
      children
        - label HTTP/3 priorities honoured
          desc Critical chunk served before deferred vendor chunks
        - label 103 Early Hints sent
          desc 100-500 ms head start on critical JS, font, hero
        - label Hot functions reach TurboFan
          desc No deopt loop in the interaction hot path
        - label SRI + strict CSP enforced
          desc CDN tampering rejected by the browser
    - label Poorly delivered: LCP 2.3 s
      children
        - label Flat CDN priorities
          desc Up to 20-30% of code-split benefit erased
        - label No Early Hints
          desc Preload waits until the full HTML is generated
        - label Deopt loop in a hot handler
          desc Re-JITs every call, burns CPU at any bundle size
        - label unsafe-inline CSP, no SRI
          desc A silent CDN compromise ships malicious JS
theme
  palette #10b981 #f43f5e
